{
  "title": "Shadow of the Towers: Command Rise",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Shadow of the Towers: Command Rise</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Exploration</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Chapter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers\">Shadow of the Towers</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Itzel sugests that Liel might be in the nearby rise. So the three of you decide to venture inside to search for Liel.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Hidden rewards can be found in this area.</b></span></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quests</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Resounding_Rise\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise\">Shadow of the Towers: Resounding Rise</a><hr /><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers:_Twilight_Rise\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers: Twilight Rise\">Shadow of the Towers: Twilight Rise</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 400</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 40</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-0\"><span typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Item_The_Recipe_of_Call_of_the_Abyss.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Item The Recipe of Call of the Abyss.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"74\" data-height=\"74\">The Recipe of Call of the Abyss</span></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Advanced Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d6/Item_Advanced_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094344\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 4</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Energy_Core\" title=\"Advanced Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Advanced Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153038\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 26,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Insula (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5zdWxhP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Insula</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Itzel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXR6ZWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Itzel</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Shadow of the Towers: Command Rise</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration_Quest\" title=\"Exploration Quest\">Exploration Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Thessaleo_Fells\" title=\"Thessaleo Fells\">Thessaleo Fells</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Head to the camp to find Insula and Itzel</li>\n<li>Enter the Command Rise</li>\n<li>Go deeper into the Command Rise</li>\n<li>Pursue the Abyssal Patricius</li>\n<li>Enter the top of the tower\n<ol><li>(Optional) Talk to Itzel</li>\n<li>(Optional) Talk to Insula</li></ol></li>\n<li>Leave the Command Rise</li>\n<li>Talk to your two companions\n<ol><li>Talk to Insula</li>\n<li>Talk to Itzel</li></ol></li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing this quest awards the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Footprints_in_Rinascita_I\" title=\"Footprints in Rinascita I\">Footprints in Rinascita I</a></i> trophy <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_of_the_Towers_(Trophy)\" title=\"Shadow of the Towers (Trophy)\">Shadow of the Towers</a></i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Itzel sugests that Liel might be in the nearby rise. So the three of you decide to venture inside to search for Liel.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Hidden rewards can be found in this area.</b></span></div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> What did I tell ya, Itzel? There's our destination.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Shut up... We'd be running around like headless chickens if I listened to you. It was I who pinned that tower down!</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Hey, don't make a fuss... Oh, hi friend! You're here!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> And so are you two.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Of course. Itzel says she feels the monster's frequencies from within that tower.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Unlike the decoys in the other two towers, this one there is probably real.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Come on. Time to bring <span class=\"new\" title=\"Liel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGllbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Liel</span> back.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> That brat had better be in one piece when we find him!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Like the last two towers, this place is filled with poisonous gas. We might see visions of the past here as well.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Let's look at the vision here... Oh crap, the Fanatic Sharks captured Liel.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Those fish nuts... Watch out friend, something's attacking us from above.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Liel, wait up...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Show us the way!</dd>\n<dd><b>Liel Specter:</b> Savages...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Taste this!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Out of the way! I'll slaughter you all to get Liel back!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(When TD escapes)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Blasted thing keeps running away.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Argh, the path is broken. Wait, what's that floating in the air? It's Liel's vision!</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> He got away from the Fanatic Shark? Can't be. When did he learn to fly?</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> He's not flying. He's running on something... Are those bookcases on the right?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Liel Specter:</b> Woo hoo! I'm blazing fast!</dd>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Your going nowhere boy!!!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Look at that little rascal scamper...</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Takes after his sister. Hahaha! He might even be a secret Resonator!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> These Fanatic Sharks all got skewered!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> They were ambused. Everyone stay alert!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Even if Liel got away, he's no match for that prowling monster.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Don't worry, he's a smart kid, and he's wearing your jammer. He can handle a few Tacet Discords.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I hope so... You'd better not be dead, you idiot...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(When TD escapes)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Those archers again! And look, Fanatic Shark specters... They met their end here!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Oh Liel, I hope you made it out alive.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> I don't want to die!</dd>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Captain, I'm hit...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Liel Specter:</b> End of the line, fish face!</dd>\n<dd><b>Specter:</b> Curse you!!!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> Go Liel!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> ...</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Itzel, you don't look to well. Didn't you see? Liel dealt with that Fanatic Shark.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> But how was he getting out?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Liel Specter:</b> Sis... Chief... I'm not gonna make it...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Liel...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> ...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Idle)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> We're here now, kid...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Liel...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Optional - Talk to Itzel)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Liel...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I was kidding about the fish guts. Don't go Liel, I'll serve you the plumpest side of the fattest fish we have.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You know... Liel's love of fish was what got me into fishing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> You can have all my catch once we're out of ehre. They're meaningless to me now.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> But before we leaven that monster at the top of the tower must die.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Optional - Talk to Insula)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Liel... I was training him to lead our crew someday.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Come friend, let's go... whatever's in our way will get smashed to a pulp.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Go to the top of the tower)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> What is this place? Are we at the center of the tower?</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Blinky's here. It's summoned a bunch of <span class=\"text-help\"><b>copies</b></span>!</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Damn, their frequencies show only one <span class=\"text-help\"><b>copy</b></span> is <span class=\"text-help\"><b>real</b></span>.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> We'll destroy the <span class=\"text-help\"><b>real copy</b></span> to kill it for good.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Abyssal Patricius</dt>\n<dd>Shadow of Fisalia at low HP)</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Die! Every bit of you!</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> This one's for Liel!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Defeat the enemy)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Go to hell!</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Rest in peace Liel.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Cutscene plays)</dt>\n<dt>(Cutscene ends)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Insula)</dt>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Thank you for helping us, friend.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Have you spoken to Itzel? She could use a kind ear.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> What a day. The life of an island Exile, robbing just to survive... People like us die every day.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> But Liel... Liel was different. He was too kind for this kind of life. He did the sailing for us, never the plundering.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> I really liked that kid... Had dreams of training him to be the next captain. Ha, an odd choice now that I think about it...</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> If he became captain, maybe we'd stop being Exiles and turn a new leaf—as legitimate traders and such.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> But that's all a pointless dream now... The fate of the crew still rests with me. I have to guide them through this muck.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> It's over now, friend. Itzel and I thank you for accompanying us.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> What's next for you and your crew?</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> We'll fix our ship and leave this place of sorrow behind.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> None of us want to stay in Rinascita after what we've been through.</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> I guess we should say our goodbyes. So long, friend!</dd>\n<dd><b>Insula:</b> Oh, and if you're ever on a ship we've captured, you get to keep your stuff, haha!</dd>\n<dd><i>But Insula's laughter is hollow. His expression is stony, and he sinks into silence.</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Itzel)</dt>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Friend...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I can't bring Liel back from the dead, but I've avenged his death by destroying his killer. That's all I can do.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> So, you got any questions for me?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> About you and Liel...\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> We sailed Sentinel knows how many seas. I always thought the ocean would be our grave.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Never thought Liel would meet his end on land... in the depth of an icy tower...</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> About this tower...\n<dl><dd><b>Itzel:</b> I've got a theory for the tower.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I saw small devices hidden away in most corners back there... much like the fractured halo at the top of the tower.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> My guess is the tower is a lab, and those devices were used as some kind of experimental Echo control.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Those controlled Echoes were extremely dangerous... the exact opposite of the cuddly Echoes I heard about in Rinascita.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Someone in the Land of Echoes sought to weaponize them...</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> The tower's broken halo must have been the largest and most powerful of their devices.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> I shudder to think of the horrors that'd be unleashed it ever got completed.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I don't have any.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> The only thing I have left of Liel is this compass pendant.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> It was my gift to him after we divvied the spoils from our first job.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Whenever we got lost at sea, it always guided us back home.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> But Liel was so afraid of losing it, so he left it with me for safekeeping.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> After we leave this tower, Insula and I will repair our ship and leave this wretched place.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Once we return to familiar waters, I'll throw this compass out at sea.</dd>\n<dd><b>Itzel:</b> Maybe, just maybe, Liel will follow our ship's course, find the compass, and let it guide him home...</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><sp